Hi Andrea,
I've been using the same dataset as for Wallace 1.0.6.3, with no issue in that case.
I used my own occurrence dataset, I have two groups with N=70 and 56. For the environmental data I download and cut a dataset from ecoClimate. I used a jackknife partition method and for the background minimum convex polygon with buffer 2.5 and 1 respectively.
For maxent settings,used  several feature classes (L, LQ, H,LQH, LQHP), regularization multipliers from 0.5 to 5 with 0.5 increments and clamping.
I've made diferent tries with and without parallel.
Hope that you can find where the problem is.
Thanks
Jimena

