Hi Jimena,

For wallace 1.0.6.3 where you also using ecoclimate as user provided layers ? Are your occurrences distributed all over the world? In a single country? Region? My guess without seeing the data is that you don’t have enough data at ecoclim’s coarser resolution to generate a model. Another problem could be the format of your input occurrence dataset. The format is slightly changed for 1.9, are the occurrences plotting correctly? If yes then can you try running with worldclim and let me know if you get the same error?

Andrea
